    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battles For Glory</strong> is a classic <strong>MMORPG RvR</strong> game where faction-versus-faction conflict and world map control are combined. From early morning until late evening, there are sieges and defenses of outposts, cities, castles, and fortresses, as well as battles for territories, bosses, artifacts, and numerous events. This is a world where magic and steel reign supreme.</p>",
